mastery weight recognition 0.30 recall 0.25 implementation 0.45
mastery within a dimension is 0.65 maturity plus 0.35 retrievability
mastery maturity is stability days over 21 capped at 1
mastery gate rule 1 capped at 0.60 until 3 implementation reviews
mastery gate rule 2 cannot exceed implementation score plus 0.15
mastery unlock threshold is 0.65
scheduler is FSRS 6 one card per pattern per dimension
scheduler default target retention is 0.90
SM-2 is rejected because a single ease factor causes ease hell
FSRS models difficulty stability retrievability on a power-law curve
rating recognition under 0.5x par is easy over 1.5x par is hard
rating recall self-graded but a missed essential point forces again
rating implementation not accepted is again hints cap at hard
rating a judge failure produces no rating and no log entry
lapse means again on a card that had reached the review state
lapse does not include failing during initial learning
XP diminishing returns 0.5 to the power k floored at 0.125
XP due review bonus 1.5x
XP is awarded from the outcome never from the rating
XP is never subtracted
unlocks are permanent and never revoked when a prerequisite decays
unlocks follow the prerequisite DAG not the world list
