anti-memorisation distractors are weighted by your own past confusions
anti-memorisation the classic problem reference is revealed only after
differential judging uses the intact template as the oracle
differential judging requires no authored expected outputs
hole markers are comments so the template still compiles
every hole must accept its reference body and reject an empty answer
content is versioned YAML the database holds user state only
